{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42178","headline":"和锺郎中送朱先辈还京垂寄 · 徐铉","name":"和锺郎中送朱先辈还京垂寄","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"分司洗马无人问，辞客殷勤辍棹歌。\n苍藓满庭行径小，高梧临槛雨声多。\n春愁尽付千盃酒，乡思遥闻一曲歌。\n且共胜游消永日，西冈风物近如何。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"徐铉","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_42178.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42178","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}